    "notes": "User accepted the visual candidate for publication on 2026-09-16. Structural and LiDAR agreement checks pass. This is a draft publication, not a claim of completed rights or map/device review. Palette was updated for Clair on 2026-09-23; this color revision awaits renewed visual review."
